 throughout the video.\n\ndetailed_description:\nThe target video uses the two reference images as character identity references for the two cats. The action is continuous and readable, with clear cause and effect.\n[Shot 1] The orange cat walks along a road, carrying a vegetable basket. The basket sways slightly with each step, and the orange cat keeps moving forward naturally.\n[Shot 2] At 00:03.000, from behind the orange cat, the black-and-white cow-patterned cat rides a bicycle quickly toward the orange cat. The bicycle wheels spin, and the cow-patterned cat closes the distance from the rear.\n[Shot 3] At 00:07.000, the cow-patterned cat reaches out and snatches the Chinese cabbage from the orange cat's basket. The orange cat reacts with shock and turns toward the snatcher; the cabbage is visibly taken from the basket and ends up in the cow-patterned cat's possession.\n[Shot 4] At 00:10.500, the orange cat chases the cow-patterned cat madly along the road. The cow-patterned cat rides away with the cabbage while the orange cat runs after it at full speed. The chase continues visibly until the 15-second mark, ending on the ongoing pursuit without freezing or empty pause. No subtitles, titles, watermarks, logos, or corner marks are present.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nRoad ambience, paw steps, bicycle rolling and chain sounds, basket sway, a quick snatching motion, and fast running footsteps during the chase. No dialogue.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nN/A", "match"], "inputs": [{"name": "h3_text_encoder", "link": 9, "label": "h3_text_encoder", "type": "MINIMAX_H3_TEXT_ENCODER", "localized_name": "h3_text_encoder"}, {"name": "h3_vae_bundle", "link": 10, "label": "h3_vae_bundle", "type": "MINIMAX_H3_VAE_BUNDLE", "localized_name": "h3_vae_bundle"}, {"name": "target", "link": 11, "label": "target", "type": "MINIMAX_H3_TARGET", "localized_name": "target"}, {"name": "references", "link": 45, "label": "references", "type": "MINIMAX_H3_REFERENCES", "localized_name": "references"}, 